; Generated by `bookkeeper sync` (bookkeeper.ingest / bookkeeper.simplefin):
; `open` directives for each SimpleFIN-backed Assets:SimpleFIN:<Name> account.
; Generated -- do not hand-edit, and do not open these accounts in
; accounts.beancount, which stays hand-curated for expense/envelope accounts
; only. Rewritten wholesale on every sync from the accounts SimpleFIN
; currently reports; the open date is a fixed sentinel (not derived from any
; account's data) so this file is byte-identical across reruns with no new
; accounts.
2000-01-01 open Assets:SimpleFIN:Checking   USD
2000-01-01 open Assets:SimpleFIN:EmptyAccount   USD
2000-01-01 open Assets:SimpleFIN:Savings   USD
